 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "The share of imports from EU27 countries in Luxembourg increased from 71.1 % in 2015 to 86.6 % in 2025.",
  "This represents a rise of 21.7 % over the period.",
  "In contrast, imports from non-EU27 countries decreased from 28.9 % in 2015 to 13.4 % in 2025, a drop of 53.4 %.",
  "The highest share of imports from EU27 countries was 91.5 % in 2024, while the peak for non-EU27 imports was 28.9 % in 2015.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
